exports[`renderAuditorUnit — reference bytes > rgaa · en · heading 1`] = `
"### 🔴 11.6 — Légende

> Auditor view — RGAA 4.1.2. Normative mapping.

**Thématique** : 11. Formulaires
**Critère** : 11.6 — Légende
**Test(s)** : 11.6.1
**WCAG** : 1.3.1 (A) · 3.3.2 (A)
**Priority** : 🔴 Blocking

**Finding (Non conforme (NC))** : 1 occurrence(s) — image sans alternative
**Expected (Conforme (C))** : Ajoutez alt
**Verification** : check each occurrence below (inspector / screen reader), then re-run the audit (\`ultra11y\` / axe).

- [ ] \`src/a.tsx:3\` (\`img\`) — image sans alternative

#### Technical details

**Impacted files**

- \`src/a.tsx\`

**Expected change**

- Ajoutez alt

**Example** — A <fieldset> without a <legend> is non-compliant: the group exists but has no announced title.

_Avoid :_
\`\`\`html
<fieldset>
  <input type="checkbox" id="cgu" name="cgu">
  <label for="cgu">J'accepte les conditions</label>
  <input type="checkbox" id="news" name="news">
  <label for="news">Recevoir la newsletter</label>
</fieldset>
\`\`\`

_Recommended :_
\`\`\`html
<fieldset>
  <legend>Préférences du compte</legend>
  <input type="checkbox" id="cgu" name="cgu">
  <label for="cgu">J'accepte les conditions</label>
  <input type="checkbox" id="news" name="news">
  <label for="news">Recevoir la newsletter</label>
</fieldset>
\`\`\`

**Acceptance criteria**

- [ ] **Given** the affected \`img\` elements · **When** a user of assistive technology reaches them · **Then** « Info and Relationships » (WCAG 1.3.1).
- [ ] **Given** the affected \`img\` elements · **When** a user of assistive technology reaches them · **Then** « Labels or Instructions » (WCAG 3.3.2).

**Complexity** : S (3 pts)
"
`;

